   "route": "about-us",
   "title": "About us",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "web_template": "PCPB Page Header",
     "values": {
      "title": "About the Board",
      "text": "Who we are, our mandate and our commitments.",
      "show_crumbs": 1
     },
     "shade": 0
    },
    {
     "web_template": "PCPB Text",
     "values": {
      "content": "<p>The Pest Control Products Board (PCPB) is a statutory body established under the Pest Control Products Act, Cap 346 of the Laws of Kenya. The Board regulates the manufacture, import, export, distribution, sale, use and disposal of pest control products.</p>\n<h3>Vision</h3><p>To be a world class regulatory agency for pest control products.</p>\n<h3>Mission</h3><p>To regulate pest control products so that they are safe, effective and of good quality, protecting human health, animals and the environment.</p>\n<h3>Core values</h3><ul><li>Customer focus</li><li>Professionalism</li><li>Integrity</li><li>Confidentiality</li><li>Equity and equality</li><li>Teamwork</li><li>Innovation</li></ul>"
     },
     "shade": 0
    },
    {
